Keep every native Wayle panel directly below the top Waybar and flush with the
right edge of its selected monitor. The transparent click-away host must be
resizable so four opposing layer-shell anchors can expand it to the monitor;
the hosted dropdown itself must not expand inside GtkOverlay.

